/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 91 0 R
/E (Phishing is a type of cyber attack where criminals pretend to be trusted sources to trick you into sharing sensitive information. They send fake emails, messages, or create fake websites that look real. Their goal is to steal your passwords, credit card numbers, or personal data. Think of it like a digital con artist wearing a disguise to gain your trust and steal your information.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
