/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 92 0 R
/E (Phishing attacks come in many forms, each designed to trick you in different ways. Understanding these common types will help you recognize and avoid them. Here are the three most prevalent phishing methods you're likely to encounter in your daily life.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
