/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 92 0 R
/T (Smishing \(SMS Phishing\) Phishing via text messages. You might receive texts claiming to be from delivery services, banks, or government agencies with urgent requests to click links. These often include shortened URLs to hide malicious destinations.)
/E (Smishing \(SMS Phishing\) Phishing via text messages. You might receive texts claiming to be from delivery services, banks, or government agencies with urgent requests to click links. These often include shortened URLs to hide malicious destinations.)
